{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Aspect Mastery raises the Aspects' chance to trigger (#974)",
  "contract": "Aspect Mastery 572416 (rank 2; rank 1 704389 carries +5) has E2 SPELL_AURA_ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER (107) on SPELLMOD_CHANCE_OF_SUCCESS (18), EffectBasePoints 9 (+10), EffectSpellClassMask word2 0x800, and its description promises to raise the Aspects' chance to trigger by $s3%. Aspect of the Cosmos 801123 has SpellFamilyFlags word2 0x800, so the modifier applies to its record, whose ProcChance is 40 (starcaller warden-1 report, DBC read). 801123 procs through aura_ascension_starcaller_event -> Aspect() (AscensionStarcaller.cpp), which rolled Chance(player, 801123) on the raw ProcChance, ignoring SPELLMOD_CHANCE_OF_SUCCESS; only the native roll (Aura::CalcProcChance) saw the mask, so the effective chance was 0.5 (native, with the mod, once rev_20260919_20 clears spell_proc.Chance) x 0.4 (script) = 20% instead of 40+10 = 50%. Chance() now applies the modifier and rev_20260921_11 sets spell_proc.Chance to 100 so the script roll is the only roll. Aspect() casts Aspect of the Cosmos' helper 801124 on the target when it fires (unless talent 300772 is known, which this fixture does not have), and the new spell_cast_count metric counts casts of 801124 by the actor, triggered included. Trigger: Celestial Strike 800496, melee class, instant, no cooldown, with 10000 melee hit rating so every cast lands; Cosmos triggers on any non-periodic melee or ranged damage (Events.cpp). 100 casts at the fixed expectation 50%: the talented count reaches at least 33 (P(X<33 at 0.5) = 0.02% false failure) while the pre-fix 20% reaches 33 with P = 0.16%. Cosmos 801123 is not passive (Spell.dbc Attributes 0x81050000 has no 0x40, 10000 ms recovery), so learning it applies no aura and a first run failed the aura assertion (actual 0); the scenario applies the aura with set_aura, which AddAura's it on the player with the record's own duration index 21, and asserts it before casting. A second run passed the aura assertion but counted 20 of 100 casts: Celestial Strike 800496 costs 40 energy (Spell.dbc PowerType 3, ManaCost 40) and base energy regeneration is 10 per second (Player::Regenerate), so a cast every 1.7 s afforded only about 45 casts and the rest were dropped; 45 casts at 50% is about 22. Each cast is now preceded by set_power (power 3, value 50) so all 100 strikes land.",
  "timeout_ms": 400000,
